  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 16 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nJust a two-minute walk from Milford Beach; the location couldn't be better.\r\n\r\nThis 1990s, two-level, four-bedroom townhouse offers comfort, size and convenience.\r\nOn the ground floor, there is the open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area, which extends into an additional living/TV room.\r\n\r\nThe dining and living areas open onto the sunny, northeast-facing courtyard, perfect for those summer BBQs. The double garage has internal access for convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs offers four generous bedrooms. The master bedroom includes an ensuite, a walk-through wardrobe and a peak of the sea from the Juliet balcony. An additional bathroom services the other three bedrooms.\r\n\r\n There is also a study area and a separate laundry.\r\n\r\nJust moments from the Milford shopping Mall and Milford Cruising Club and park.\r\n\r\nThis property offers huge potential for savvy buyers. The property has water tightness issues and is offered on an 'as is, where is' basis.\r\n\r\nViewing is a must!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
